close_reason: "Declared owner-terminal disposition shipped: bounds hold past a finished owner by default, explicit retirement requires a recorded reason, cancellation no longer silences a guard, and both drifted populations are re-declared and held at 243 and 50. Gate moved from 23 enforced with 3 retired to 26 enforced with 0 retired; negative control extended to four declarations and proves a held bound still fails after its owner closed."
body: ""
